sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as IMAP session
    participant MB as mbox/ID (shard 0)
    participant R as registry "mailboxes"
    participant D as msg/GUID/0
    participant F as full-text objects
    P->>MB: CAS: remove m:UID, new MODSEQ, log it, write intent r:UID
    P->>R: CAS: give back usage (q:bytes, q:msgs)
    P->>MB: record in r:UID that the usage is released (f)
    P->>D: CAS on xattr refs: refs - 1
    alt refs is still above 0
        Note over MB,D: another copy still needs the blob, it stays
    else refs is now 0
        P->>F: take the document out of the full-text index
        P->>D: delete every chunk msg/GUID/N
    end
    P->>MB: remove r:UID
    Note over P,D: A crash anywhere above leaves r:UID behind.<br/>The scrub finds it and recounts, it never releases twice.
